I will select the superhero_name (to identify the hero) and the colour column from the colour table joined three separate times to the superhero table using the eye_colour_id, hair_colour_id, and skin_colour_id foreign keys. I will join the superhero table to the gender table on gender_id and to the publisher table on publisher_id. I will filter where gender.gender = 'Female' and publisher.publisher_name = 'Dark Horse Comics'.

